# arch-aarch64.pkgs — the Raspberry Pi half.
#
# ⛔ THE KERNEL IS PER MODEL AND THEY ARE NOT INTERCHANGEABLE. Void ships
# rpi4-kernel and rpi5-kernel as separate packages; build/config.sh picks one.
# There is an rpi4-base but NO rpi5-base in the repository — the Pi 5 takes the
# generic rpi-base with rpi5-kernel beside it. Assuming symmetry here produces an
# image that builds cleanly and does not boot.
rpi-firmware
rpi-userland
mesa-dri
xf86-video-fbdev
